brad pitt is accusing his ex-wife  angelina jolie of trying to inflict harm  on him and his interests in their  chateau miraval winery that's life isn't  it a new legal docs filed in los angeles  on friday pitts lawyers claim jolie sold  her stake in their winery to russian  oligarch yuri scheffler in an effort to  damage his involvement in the company  but how did this legal battle all begin  well it started in february when pitt  first sued jolie over the sale of her  shares of mirror ball he was seeking  monetary damages legal fees and wanted  her sail to scheffler to be voided and  now in the latest docks pitt's attorneys  claim that she sought to inflict harm on  him and alleges that she knew and  intended that scheffler and his  affiliates would try to control the  business pitt had built and to undermine  pitt's investment in miraval the docs  also claimed that the vineyard became  pitt's passion and grew into a  multi-million dollar business as for  jolie well he alleges she contributed  nothing to miraval's success and since  scheffler who owns spy group the parent  company behind many alcohol brands  obtained a stake in miraval he's  allegedly launched a hostile takeover of  the wine business and get this the docs  also allege that jolie has not returned  to the vineyard since the two filed for  divorce in 2016. and according to pitt's  lawsuit back in february he claimed that  per the terms of their divorce which was  finalized in 2019 the couple had a  mutual understanding that neither of  them could sell off their interest in  the winery without the other's consent  e.t has reached out to jolie's reps for  comment  [Music]
 

